    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "title": "① This is an adapter for the proven Long Video background graph",
      "pos": [
        0,
        650
      ],
      "size": [
        1020,
        390
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 5,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## 必须接到现有Long Video后台成片链\n\n这不是独立采样工作流。把这5个节点插入`Long_Video_Background_22F`：用本节点的prompt/length/seed驱动原H3 Conditioning/Sampler；把Background Start输出的`job_id`和`auto_accept`接到现有`Auto Accept & Continue`，候选仍必须由Long Video Candidate Save生成。取消、运行中断、history、重试和accepted manifest继续由原后台控制器负责。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "title": "② Safe default and exact progress contract",
      "pos": [
        1080,
        650
      ],
      "size": [
        1020,
        390
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 6,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## 默认不会自动跑\n\n`review_only`会阻止下游，便于先检查接线。只有明确改成`auto_accept_and_continue`才会自动接受每段并排下一段。Creator的一个shot必须严格对应Long Video manifest的一个segment；`accepted_count`决定下一shot，`retry_count`决定variant，超出variant数量时固定使用最后一个seed并在report标记clamped。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "title": "③ Workspace hash binding and cancel controls",
      "pos": [
        2160,
        650
      ],
      "size": [
        1020,
        390
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 7,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## 不允许跨项目续跑\n\n后台状态只保存workspace hash、run_count等小型绑定元数据，不保存完整提示词。修改Timeline、覆盖、run window或seed后workspace hash会变化，必须换新的`chain_id`。Start节点右键区域会出现与原Long Video相同的status/pause/resume/cancel按钮；cancel可删除未运行任务或向正在运行的指定prompt发送interrupt，不会取消其他队列任务。"
      ]
    }
